Package: niri
Version: @VERSION@-1+@SUITE@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: omakasui <packages@omakasui.org>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIBS_DEPENDS@, libegl1, libwayland-server0
Recommends: xwayland-satellite, xdg-desktop-portal-gnome | xdg-desktop-portal-gtk,
 gnome-keyring, libegl-mesa0, libgl1-mesa-dri
Suggests: fuzzel, mako-notifier, alacritty
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/niri-wm/niri
Description: Scrollable-tiling Wayland compositor.
 Windows are arranged in columns on an infinite horizontal strip; opening a new
 window never causes the existing ones to resize.
 .
 Supports multi-monitor setups, fractional scaling, floating windows, NVIDIA
 GPUs, touchpads, tablets, and X11 applications via xwayland-satellite.
